3.1.12: Because of the transformation of a different sense organ [being possible].
{Established position}
3.1.13: [Objection:] No, because memory has as its object what is to be remembered.
{Objection}
3.1.14: There is no refutation, because of the existence of the qualities of that self [i.e., the soul as the common substrate].
{Established position}

